From: AshesTom <258768419+AshesTom@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uxtheme: give the named exports XP's ordinals

Purpose: let XP's Display Properties open its Appearance page.
XP behavior: uxtheme's named exports have fixed ordinals (GetCurrentThemeName
is 42, DrawThemeBackground 6, ...), and XP's modules may look them up by
ordinal.
Wine before: winebuild numbered the named exports itself; themeui's call by
ordinal reached GetThemeBackgroundRegion with GetCurrentThemeName's
arguments and crashed.
Change: number the named exports as XP does, with the ordinals that
ReactOS's uxtheme.spec records; the undocumented ones keep theirs.
Scope: every Wine application; names are unchanged.
---
 dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------------------
 1 file changed, 46 insertions(+), 46 deletions(-)

